sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UAV as UAV / Sensors
    participant UDP as UDP Listener
    participant PARSER as NCLink Parser
    participant PQ as Processing Queue
    participant LOOP as Processing Loop
    participant WS as WebSocket Manager
    participant RQ as Recording Queue
    participant OAQ as OnlineAnalysis Queue
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant REC as Recorder
    participant OA as OnlineAnalysis

    UAV->>UDP: UDP telemetry packet
    UDP->>PARSER: feed_data(data, port_type)
    PARSER-->>UDP: decoded message list
    UDP->>PQ: enqueue message

    alt queue full and high-frequency
        PQ-->>PQ: coalesce latest packet by type
    else accepted
        PQ->>LOOP: batched dequeue
        LOOP->>LOOP: build ws payload and throttle by type
        LOOP->>WS: schedule latest broadcast
        LOOP->>RQ: enqueue recording message
        opt eligible for online analysis
            LOOP->>OAQ: enqueue analysis payload
        end
    end

    WS-->>FE: latest snapshot / realtime update
    RQ->>REC: async batch write CSV / logs
    OAQ->>OA: async forward payload

    Note over UDP,LOOP: UDP callback path stays lightweight to reduce packet loss.
    Note over WS,FE: Slow frontend clients are timeout-pruned rather than blocking the pipeline.
    Note over RQ,REC: Recording is decoupled from UDP ingress and UI push.